6. Non-Functional Requirements
Data Integrity: Soft-delete functionality to prevent accidental data loss, with a 60-day retention period in "Trash" before permanent deletion.
Performance: Utilization of batch updates and caching to manage Google Sheets API quotas efficiently.
Security: Access control via Google OAuth; Role-based views (e.g., Sales only see their leads).
Cron Jobs: Scheduled tasks for payment reminders (daily at 9 AM) and cohort deadline checks (daily at 10 AM).

7. User Interface (UX) Needs
Navigation: Clean sidebar navigation to switch between Leads, Programs, and Settings.
Visual Feedback:
Color-coded backgrounds for statuses (Green for Eligible, Red for Not Eligible).
Loading states during API data fetches.
Modals: Confirmation dialogs for critical actions like status changes, outlining the automated consequences (e.g., "This will send an email").